st    | thriller  | filmmaking |\n\nNow answer the questions:\n\n1. **At what position is the person who watches adventure?**  \n   → Position 1\n\n2. **What hobby does the person who is a journalist do?**  \n   → Journalist is in position 2 → hobby is filmmaking\n\n3. **What is the job of the person who watches adventure?**  \n   → Adventure is in position 1 → job is police-officer\n\n4. **What is the job of the person who watches thriller?**  \n   → Thriller is in position 2 → job is journalist\n\nSo answers in order:\n1. 1  \n2. filmmaking  \n3. police-officer  \n4. journalist\n\nFinal answer format: <solution>answer1, answer2, answer3, answer4</solution>\n\nFinal answer: <solution>1, filmmaking, police-officer, journalist</solution>", "logprobs": [{"token": "We", "logprob": -0.07889051735401154}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.062073830515146255}, {"token": " told", "logprob": -0.8259407877922058}, {"token": " there", "logprob": -0.20633378624916077}, {"token": " are", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " two", "logprob": -0.39147353172302246}, {"token": " people", "logprob": -1.6689286894688848e-06}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.006274524610489607}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.0007014198345132172}, {"token": " line", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0006509092636406422}, {"token": " numbered", "logprob": -0.028612986207008362}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.04445183649659157}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " (", "logprob": -0.004630556795746088}, {"token": "left", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -0.003177833277732134}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.06196761503815651}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "2", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " (", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "right", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ").", "logprob": -0.0485939159989357}, {"token": " Each", "logprob": -0.1270335614681244}, {"token": " has", "logprob": -0.014163684099912643}, {"token": " unique", "logprob": -0.5982